# READ THIS BEFORE TRUSTING A SCOPE MARKER: [A8-out] means "not needed to do A8".
# It does NOT mean "untouched by A8". The A7 manifest made that stronger claim about
# tests/test_extract.py and was wrong -- that file called the function A7 changed, with
# the one data shape that broke it, and it was the only test standing in front of a
# silent production failure. If a session is about to change a function's behaviour,
# grep the whole repo for its callers rather than trusting this file's commentary.

